"text": "Exercice 9\nMontrons l’´ egalit´ e\nA∩ (B∆C) = (A∩ B)∆(A∩ C).\nOn compute\nA∩ (B∆C) = A∩\n(\n(B\\ C)∪ (C\\ B)\n)\n= A∩\n(\n(B∩ C c)∪ (C∩ B c)\n)\n= (A∩ B∩ C c)∪ (A∩ C∩ B c) = (A∩ B∩ C c)∪ (A∩ B c∩ C).\nEn mˆ eme temps\n(A∩ B)∆(A∩ C) =\n(\n(A∩ B)\\ (A∩ C)\n)\n∪\n(\n(A∩ C)\\ (A∩ B)\n)\n=\n(\n(A∩ B)∩ (A∩ C)c)\n∪\n(\n(A∩ C)∩ (A∩ B)c)\n=\n(\n(A∩ B)∩ (Ac∪ C c)\n)\n∪\n(\n(A∩ C)∩ (Ac∪ B c)\n)\n= (A∩ B∩ Ac)∪ (A∩ B∩ C c)∪ (A∩ C∩ Ac)∪ (A∩ C∩ B c)\n= ∅∪ (A∩ B∩ C c)∪∅∪ (A∩ B c∩ C)\n= (A∩ B∩ C c)∪ (A∩ B c∩ C).\nD’o` u on conclut\nA∩ (B∆C) = (A∩ B)∆(A∩ C)."
