"source": "PREING1-S1/Algebre1/TD6-Polynomes-Correction_2023-2024_Algebre1_P1S1_NArancibia.pdf",
"fmt": "pdf",
"section": "Exercice 6",
"label": "TD6 — corrigé · 2023-2024 — Exercice 6",
"text": "Exercice 6.21\nSupposons que ab = 6. Le syst` eme devient alors\n\na + b + c + d = 5\nac + ad + bc + bd + cd = 3\n6(c + d) + acd + bcd = 15\ncd = 3\n=⇒\n\na + b + c + d = 5\nac + ad + bc + bd = 0\n6(c + d) + 3(a + b) = 15\ncd = 3\n=⇒\n\na + b + c + d = 5\n(a + b)(c + d) = 0\n(a + b) + 2(c + d) = 5\ncd = 3\nD’o` u on conclut\n\na + b + c + d = 5\n(a + b)(c + d) = 0\n(a + b) + 2(c + d) = 5\ncd = 3\n=⇒\n{ a + b = 5\nc + d = 0\nAinsi\n{ a + b = 5\nab = 6 et\n{ c + d = 0\ncd = 3"
},
