"label": "TD6 — corrigé · 2023-2024 — Exercice 6",
"text": "Exercice 6.22\nPour trouver la valeur de x 2\n1 + x 2\n2 + x 2\n3 , il suﬃt de noter que\n(x1 + x2 + x3)2 = (x 2\n1 + x 2\n2 + x 2\n3 ) + 2(x1x2 + x1x3 + x2x3)\nPar cons´ equent\nx 2\n1 + x 2\n2 + x 2\n3 = (x1 + x2 + x3)2− 2(x1x2 + x1x3 + x2x3) = 4− 2 = 2.\nAinsi\nx 3\n1 + x 3\n2 + x 3\n3 = 4− 11 =−7."
