"title": "CM5 Pseudo code C Variables (E. Ansermin)",
"doc_label": "CM5 Pseudo code C Variables (E. Ansermin) · 2023-2024",
"source": "PREING1-S1/Informatique1/CM5-Pseudo-code-C-Variables_2023-2024_Informatique1_P1S1_EAnsermin-RGrignon.pdf",
