"source": "PREING1-S2/Algebre2-DS/2024-06-02-DS3-2019-2020-Correction_Algebre2-DS_P1S2_MathisS.md",
"fmt": "md",
"section": "Exercice 3 : Partie 1. › 4.b.",
"label": "DS3 — corrigé · 2019-2020 — Exercice 3 : Partie 1. › 4.b.",
"text": "Soit $u = \\lambda v + \\mu w \\in F$\n\n$$\\varphi(u) = \\varphi(\\lambda v + \\mu w) = \\lambda\\varphi(v) + \\mu\\varphi(w)$$\n\n$$\\varphi(v) = \\varphi(1,0,1) = ( - 1,1,0) = w - v$$\n\n$$\\varphi(w) = \\varphi(0,1,1) = (0,1,1) = w$$\n\n$$\\phi(u) = \\lambda(w - v) + \\mu w = - \\lambda v + (\\lambda + \\mu)w \\in F$$\n\nDonc $F$ est stable par $\\varphi$"
},
