\nt− 1\n1 +t2dt =\n∫ 1\n−1\nt¹ +t2dt−\n∫ 1\n−1\n1\n1 +t2dt =−2 arctan 1 =−π²\nf)\n∫ π²\n0\ndt\n2 + sint =\n∫ 1\n0\n2dx\n(1 +x2)\n(\n2 + 2x\n1+x2\n) =\n∫ 1\n0\n2dx\n2x2 + 2x + 2 =\n∫ 1\n0\ndx\n(\nx + 1\n2\n)2\n+ 3\n4\n= 2√\n3\n[\narctan\n( 2√\n3\n(\nx + 1\n2\n))]1\n0\n= 2√\n3\n(\narctan\n(√\n3\n)\n− arctan\n√\n3\n3\n)\n= 2√\n3\n(π\n3− π⁶\n)\n= 2√\n3\n(π⁶\n)\n= π³\n√\n3\ng)\n∫ 4\n1\n1−\n√\nt√\nt dt =\n[\n2\n√\nt\n]4\n1\n− 3 = 4− 2− 3 =−1\nh)\n∫ 4\n1\ndt\n1 +et =\n∫ 4\n1\ne−tdt\n1 +e−t =\n[\n− ln\n(\n1 +e−t)]4\n1 = ln(1 +e−1)-ln\n(\n1 +e−4)\ni) On a∫\nt(arctant)2dx = t2\n2 (arctant)2 −\n∫ ( t2\n1 +t2\n)\narctant dt=\n= t2\n2 (arctant)2−\n∫\narctant dt+\n∫ ( 1\n1 +t2\n)\narctant dt\n= t2\n2 (arctant)2−\n∫\narctant dt+ 1\n2(arctant)2\n\nOn a u(t) = arctan t\nv(t) = t et u′(t) = 1\n1 +t2\nv′(t) = 1\n= t2\n2 (arctant)2− t arctant +\n∫ t¹ +t2 dt + 1\n2(arctant)2\n= t2\n2 (arctant)2− t arctant + 1\n2 ln\n(\n1 +t2)\n+ 1\n2(arctant)2\nDonc\n∫ 1\n0\nt(arctant)2dx = π2\n16− π⁴ + 1\n2 ln 2"
