"text": "$$\\sum_{}^{}{\\ln\\left( 1 + \\frac{1}{n} \\right)z^{n}}$$\n\n$$\\ln\\left( 1 + \\frac{1}{n} \\right)\\ \\sim\\frac{1}{n}\\ \\text{or}\\ \\sum_{}^{}\\frac{z^{n}}{n}\\ \\text{est de rayon de convergence}\\ R = 1\\ \\text{alors le rayon de convergence de}\\ \\sum_{}^{}{\\ln\\left( 1 + \\frac{1}{n} \\right)z^{n}}\\ \\text{est}\\ R = 1$$"
