"text": "Calculer :\n\n1. $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n\\geq 3} \\frac{2n-1}{n(n^2-4)}$\n2. $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n\\geq 0} \\frac{n+1}{n!}$, sachant que $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n\\geq 0}\\frac{1}{n!} = e$"
