"text": "$$X(0) = \\begin{bmatrix}\nC_{1} + 13 \\\\\nC_{1} + C_{2} + 8\n\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}\n14 \\\\\n8\n\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n$$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{r}\nC_{1} + 13 = 14 \\\\\nC_{1} + C_{2} + 8 = 8\n\\end{array} \\right. $$\n\n$$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{r}\nC_{1} = 1 \\\\\nC_{1} + C_{2} = 0\n\\end{array} \\right. \\ \\begin{matrix}\n\\  \\\\\nL_{2} \\leftarrow L_{2} - L_{1}\n\\end{matrix}$$\n\n$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{r}\nC_{1} = 1 \\\\\nC_{2} = - 1\n\\end{array} \\right. $\n\nL'unique solution $X(t)$ qui vérifie $X(0) = \\begin{bmatrix}\n14 \\\\\n8\n\\end{bmatrix}$ est :\n\n$$X(t) = \\begin{bmatrix}\n(1 - 2t)e^{2t} + 13e^{t} \\\\\n - 2te^{2t} + 8e^{t}\n\\end{bmatrix}$$"
